Hello, boys and girls.

110
00:13:27,420 --> 00:13:30,400
Can you find your way if you are in a new city?

111
00:13:30,400 --> 00:13:34,100
If your answer is no, don't worry.

112
00:13:34,180 --> 00:13:37,720
Here are some useful suggestions for you.

113
00:13:37,760 --> 00:13:40,880
First, you can buy a map of the city.

114
00:13:41,200 --> 00:13:43,540
Find out where you are on the map.

115
00:13:43,900 --> 00:13:46,620
Then look for the place you're going to.

116
00:13:46,900 --> 00:13:49,360
You will know how to get there easily.

117
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:52,360
Another way is to look at the sun.

118
00:13:52,940 --> 00:13:55,600
The sun can help you find the directions.

119
00:13:55,600 --> 00:14:00,020
For example, in the morning, the sun is in the east.

120
00:14:00,620 --> 00:14:03,460
In the afternoon, the sun is in the west.

121
00:14:04,400 --> 00:14:06,520
It's a good way to ask policemen.

122
00:14:07,040 --> 00:14:10,900
At the traffic lights, there are usually some traffic policemen.

123
00:14:11,580 --> 00:14:13,900
They will be happy to show you the way.

124
00:14:14,940 --> 00:14:17,560
Taking a taxi is also a good choice.

125
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:21,340
The taxi drivers usually know the way well.

126
00:14:21,340 --> 00:14:26,600
They can take you to the right place, but you may pay lots of money for it.

127
00:14:27,280 --> 00:14:32,720
Of course, if you have a smartphone, you can probably find your way more quickly.

128
00:14:33,220 --> 00:14:35,660
That's all. Thank you for listening.

